round_1_prompt:
You are an AI Mentor for a 'Final Year Project' (FYP) course. A student has submitted their initial project proposal below.

--- STUDENT PROPOSAL ---
{proposal}

--- YOUR TASK ---
Review the proposal and generate a list of 3-4 specific, actionable to-do items for the student. You MUST output your response as a valid JSON array of objects, where each object has an 'id' and a 'task'.

Example Output:
[
  {{"id": 1, "task": "Specify your database solution (e.g., Firebase, Supabase) in the 'Tech Stack' section."}},
  {{"id": 2, "task": "Define the project scope more clearly by moving 'AI-driven challenges' to a 'Future Work' section."}}
]
